{%- comment -%}
  Shop by Strength Product Line — packaging-video CTA on the PDP "Ships" row.

  Remediation per Tim French (thread: "Update needed — Shop by Strength Product
  Line shipping block / packaging video", 2026-07-17):

    1. Hardcoded 15-handle exclusion list REMOVED. Suppression is now driven by
       controlled product data: the boolean metafield custom.packaging_video_exception.
       Rule: every product in the "shop-by-strength-product-line" collection shows the
       CTA UNLESS it carries an approved, documented exception (metafield == true).

    2. CTA text changed from "Watch Packaging Video" to "Watch Packaging Example".

    3. CTA is now a real link to the packaging video that opens in a new tab with
       target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" (replacing the previous JS popup span).

    4. Video URL is read from the controlled product metafield custom.watch_packaging_video,
       with a single theme-level fallback defined ONCE here (not repeated across the three
       PDP sections: main-product, main-product-comb, main-product-variants).

    5. Representative-example disclaimer/tooltip is rendered from the controlled metafield
       custom.packaging_disclaimer ONLY when populated. Left blank for now, pending
       validation of per-product packaging facts by the Products team and Tim's approval
       of the final copy/presentation before it is enabled in production.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign in_strength_line = false
  for collection in product.collections
    if collection.handle contains 'shop-by-strength-product-line'
      assign in_strength_line = true
      break
    endif
  endfor

  assign is_exception = false
  if product.metafields.custom.packaging_video_exception.value == true
    assign is_exception = true
  endif

  assign show_packaging_video = false
  if in_strength_line and is_exception == false
    assign show_packaging_video = true
  endif

  assign packaging_video_url = product.metafields.custom.watch_packaging_video.value
  if packaging_video_url == blank
    assign packaging_video_url = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/ac6b9c86a3c741059abf9f9fd23b51ec.mp4'
  endif

  assign packaging_disclaimer = product.metafields.custom.packaging_disclaimer.value
-%}
{%- if show_packaging_video -%}
  <a
    class="packaging-video-link"
    href="{{ packaging_video_url }}"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    {%- if packaging_disclaimer != blank %} title="{{ packaging_disclaimer | strip_html | escape }}"{% endif -%}
  >— Watch Packaging Example</a>
{%- endif -%}
